bin/
*.test
*.out
.env
.env.local
.env.production
.DS_Store
# Per-machine Claude Code state (agent worktrees, local settings) —
# never committed; leaks into PRs otherwise. The shared review-gate agents
# under .claude/agents/ are the one exception, so the ignore is `**/.claude/*`
# (a file cannot be re-included once its parent directory is excluded; the
# `**/` keeps a NESTED .claude ignored, and the anchored negations re-include
# only the repository root's agents).
**/.claude/*
!/.claude/agents/
!/.claude/agents/**
